== Statistics Advancement

As you play, the Game Master will give you Experience Points. You can
spend them between game sessions on Developments.

The base amount of XP given for a session is 3. The GM can grant bonus
XP for good role-playing, succeeding at difficult challenges, or other
impressive feats.

=== Developments

Developments refer to mechanical changes in your character. These can be
things like new skills, improved skills, and so on. The costs are as
follows.

